# Scaena flow: session replay. The differentiator, as one reproducible file.
# A human signs in ONCE and captures the state with `scaena snapshot --full`. From then on this flow
# restores that signed-in state and captures the screen behind the auth wall. Scaena never authenticates.
#
# Prerequisite: session.tar next to this file, produced once by:
#   scaena snapshot com.spocken.app session.tar --full
restore  com.spocken.app session.tar
launch   com.spocken.app com.made.murmur.MainActivity
wait     8000
capture  behind-the-wall
stop     com.spocken.app
